        "product_accordion": {
          "type": "product_accordion",
          "settings": {
            "accordion_heading": "Description",
            "heading_style": "font-body",
            "accordion_text": "<h1>PetX™ AquaGuard No-Spill Dog Water Bowl</h1><p></p><p>Ensure your beloved pet stays hydrated without the mess with the innovative Zoo Galaxy™ AquaGuard No-Spill Dog Water Bowl. Designed to cater to the natural drinking habits of your dog, this bowl combines functionality, safety, and convenience in one stylish package. Whether at home, on a road trip, or during outdoor activities, the AquaGuard bowl is your go-to solution for a clean, splash-free hydration experience.</p><h3>Why Choose Zoo Galaxy™ AquaGuard No-Spill Dog Water Bowl?</h3><h4>1. <strong>No More Messy Floors</strong></h4><p>The AquaGuard bowl features a unique double-layer design with a splash-proof rim and floating disk that effectively minimizes water spillage. This means no more wet floors or constant clean-ups after your dog drinks. Enjoy a tidier home while providing your pet with easy access to water.</p><h4>2. <strong>Slow Water Dispensing for Healthier Drinking</strong></h4><p>The bowl's innovative floating disk only releases a small amount of water at a time, encouraging your dog to drink slowly. This reduces the risk of choking and vomiting, making it particularly beneficial for dogs that tend to gulp their water too quickly. It's an ideal choice for puppies, elderly dogs, and those with digestive issues.</p><p></p><h4>3. <strong>Perfect for Travel and Active Lifestyles</strong></h4><p>Whether you're on a road trip or spending a day outdoors, the AquaGuard bowl ensures your pet stays hydrated without the hassle of spills. Its anti-splash design and stable, anti-slip base make it perfect for use in cars, RVs, and even camping trips. Keep your pet comfortable and hydrated wherever you go.</p><h4>4. <strong>Large Capacity for All-Day Hydration</strong></h4><p>With a generous 152oz/4.5L capacity, this bowl is ideal for families with multiple pets or large dog breeds. You won’t need to refill it constantly, even during the busiest days. Plus, the spacious design accommodates dogs of all sizes, ensuring they always have access to fresh water.</p><h4>5. <strong>High-Quality, Pet-Safe Materials</strong></h4><p>Your pet’s health is our priority. The AquaGuard bowl is made from premium stainless steel and BPA-free plastic, providing a safe, durable, and non-toxic option for your furry friend. The sturdy construction resists wear and tear, and the stainless steel material prevents bacterial growth, ensuring the water stays fresh and clean.</p><p></p><h4>6. <strong>Easy to Clean and Maintain</strong></h4><p>The AquaGuard bowl is designed for hassle-free maintenance. The floating disk and silicone plug are easily removable for thorough cleaning, and they can be hand-washed or placed in the dishwasher. We recommend cleaning the floating disk at least once a week to maintain optimal water quality. With minimal effort, you can keep your pet's drinking water clean and hygienic.</p><h4>7. <strong>Enhanced Filtration for Pure Water</strong></h4><p>The AquaGuard bowl is compatible with Zoo Galaxy™ AquaGuard Replacement Filters, which use activated carbon and ion exchange resin to remove impurities, debris, and odors from the water. This encourages your pet to drink more, supporting their overall health. Regularly replace the filters to ensure your dog always has access to the cleanest water possible.</p><p></p><h3>Recommendations for Optimal Use</h3><p><strong>Placement:</strong> Place the bowl on a flat, stable surface away from high-traffic areas to avoid accidental tipping. The anti-slip base helps keep the bowl in place, even on slippery surfaces.</p><p><strong>Travel Tips:</strong> When using the bowl in the car, ensure it's on a flat surface and secured to prevent movement. The spill-proof design is effective even on bumpy roads, but for added security, consider placing it in a designated pet travel area.</p><p><strong>Filter Maintenance:</strong> To keep the water fresh, replace the AquaGuard filters every 3-4 weeks, or more frequently if the water quality is poor. Soak the new filters in clean water for 10 minutes before use to activate the carbon and prevent dust particles from entering the water.</p><p><strong>Cleaning Routine:</strong> Clean the bowl, floating disk, and silicone plug at least once a week. For best results, disassemble the parts and use warm, soapy water. Rinse thoroughly and air dry before reassembling.</p><p></p><h3>Make the Smart Choice for Your Pet's Health</h3><p>The Zoo Galaxy™ AquaGuard No-Spill Dog Water Bowl is more than just a water bowl—it's a commitment to your pet's well-being. By providing clean, spill-free water access, you're helping your pet stay hydrated and healthy while keeping your home clean and dry. Give your dog the best with Zoo Galaxy™ AquaGuard and enjoy peace of mind knowing you’re providing the highest quality care.</p><p> </p>",
            "accordion_page": "",
            "padding_bottom": 10
          }
        },
